{"kind":"FETCH","data":{"headers":{},"body":"{\"id\":1360677,\"title\":\"The Devil's Climb\",\"tagline\":\"Hell isn't below, it's 9000 feet above.\",\"overview\":\"Climbers Alex Honnold and Tommy Caldwell set out on a daring expedition to tackle Alaska's formidable Devils Thumb. Battling harsh conditions and daunting peaks, they push their physical and mental limits, while their deep friendship faces its toughest trial yet.\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/qjecaspP70FPUL8G6TxzKYplDw3.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/iSh1Bc8uhcFjnJbJdN8EN6MOYRn.jpg\",\"rating\":7.6,\"voteCount\":37,\"year\":2024,\"runtime\":75,\"genres\":[\"Documentary\",\"Adventure\"],\"status\":\"Released\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"countries\":[{\"code\":\"US\",\"name\":\"United States of America\"}],\"budget\":0,\"revenue\":0,\"director\":\"Renan Öztürk\",\"cast\":[{\"id\":1123183,\"name\":\"Renan Öztürk\",\"character\":\"Director\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/8n6t81MDM1CGmdACuqDV6AtjJFV.jpg\"},{\"id\":107800,\"name\":\"Alex Honnold\",\"character\":\"Self\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/jKpVo1wTFK7VoCULHFKpoxDgHRw.jpg\"},{\"id\":107798,\"name\":\"Tommy Caldwell\",\"character\":\"self\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/jEGsQatwOpN3Cy24y8pBZI4bctS.jpg\"}],\"similar\":[{\"id\":515042,\"title\":\"Free Solo\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/v4QfYZMACODlWul9doN9RxE99ag.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/z2uuQasY4gQJ8VDAFki746JWeQJ.jpg\",\"rating\":7.9,\"year\":2018,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Follow Alex Honnold as he attempts to become the first person to ever free solo climb Yosemite's 3,000 foot high El Capitan wall. With no ropes or safety gear, this would arguably be the greatest feat in rock climbing history.\",\"genres\":[\"Documentary\",\"Adventure\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":11194,\"title\":\"Touching the Void\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/fsydA5H8FSDaYlYWddfMpMpDUX.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/7c4vVXeI1m1wR4jGZHlR6GawgxH.jpg\",\"rating\":7.6,\"year\":2003,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"The true story of Joe Simpson and Simon Yates' disastrous and nearly-fatal mountain climb of 6,344m Siula Grande in the Cordillera Huayhuash in the Peruvian Andes in 1985.\",\"genres\":[\"Documentary\",\"Action\",\"Adventure\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":682587,\"title\":\"The Alpinist\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/tYbSGAVbyACEExptLu63CxCGm4O.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/uhhTABBddHoOTV0BarymFTgOee6.jpg\",\"rating\":7.8,\"year\":2021,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"The life of Canadian mountain climber Marc-André Leclerc as he pushes the boundaries of climbing while on an expedition to Patagonia.\",\"genres\":[\"Documentary\",\"Adventure\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":57586,\"title\":\"African Cats\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/nERPMF2kHjc1slLHZYZGwcWX9kg.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/mFTlNXsPzny0geJLxdo3ddzFR1Q.jpg\",\"rating\":7.3,\"year\":2011,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"African Cats captures the real-life love, humor and determination of the majestic kings of the savanna. The story features Mara, an endearing lion cub who strives to grow up with her mother’s strength, spirit and wisdom; Sita, a fearless cheetah and single mother of five mischievous newborns; and Fang, a proud leader of the pride who must defend his family from a once banished lion.\",\"genres\":[\"Documentary\",\"Adventure\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":489471,\"title\":\"The Dawn Wall\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/bZQCNGb1II5eWASBhEgJBGxOPUM.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/ipXrm6SEjfNkD8FKfj9VLUE9fUU.jpg\",\"rating\":8,\"year\":2017,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"In an unbelievable story of perseverance, free climber Tommy Caldwell and climbing partner Kevin Jorgeson attempt to scale the impossible 3000ft Dawn Wall of El Capitan.\",\"genres\":[\"Documentary\",\"Adventure\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":68450,\"title\":\"The Art of Flight\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/q5k4edlPT6TeBnYzicIQSbprQIC.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/29pZOJSY5KXwDOeQxHkR4dQXIyB.jpg\",\"rating\":7.8,\"year\":2011,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Iconic snowboarder Travis Rice and friends redefine what is possible in the mountains. Experience the highs, as new tricks are landed and new zones opened, alongside the lows, where avalanches, accidents, and wrong-turns strike.\",\"genres\":[\"Adventure\",\"Documentary\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":665135,\"title\":\"Elephant\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/wvRbUiOuqedyDmwToErkp7wuFCv.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/jqEaYZQTwvvq6CThrtXDTfVfk7m.jpg\",\"rating\":7.7,\"year\":2020,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Disneynature’s Elephant follows African elephant Shani and her spirited son Jomo as their herd make an epic journey hundreds of miles across the vast Kalahari Desert. Led by their great matriarch, Gaia, the family faces brutal heat, dwindling resources and persistent predators, as they follow in their ancestors’ footsteps on a quest to reach a lush, green paradise.\",\"genres\":[\"Documentary\",\"Family\",\"Adventure\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":376530,\"title\":\"The Eagle Huntress\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/x0dZQM1vmDmFrOa7JoRDOTdLb3Q.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/m6Rk92lA11e4gCisMb6I8OsWQ9t.jpg\",\"rating\":7,\"year\":2016,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Follow Aisholpan, a 13-year-old girl, as she trains to become the first female in twelve generations of her Kazakh family to become an eagle hunter, and rise to the pinnacle of a tradition that has been typically been handed down from father to son for centuries.\",\"genres\":[\"Family\",\"Documentary\",\"Adventure\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":300792,\"title\":\"Racing Extinction\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/gydw7e4QCWrp5qExSJSvzyPJ42E.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/9MTbSRF0NYPxNSXdnrAbzZpvA2p.jpg\",\"rating\":7.8,\"year\":2015,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"An unlikely team of activists and innovators hatches a bold mission to save endangered species.\",\"genres\":[\"Adventure\",\"Documentary\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":133441,\"title\":\"The Summit\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/n7hRnGpAIT75xSyBnTBPfAZQ213.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/dsuzaxrCvH2WU04gdosEKslAozb.jpg\",\"rating\":6.8,\"year\":2013,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"The Summit is a 2012 documentary film about the 2008 K2 disaster directed by Nick Ryan. It combines documentary footage with dramatized recreations of the events of the 2008 K2 disaster. On the way to and from the summit, eleven climbers died during a short time span creating one of the worst catastophes in climbing history. Much of the documentary footage was captured by Swedish mountaineer Fredrik Sträng. Sträng was planning to do a Documentary which was aborted due to the fact that he did not reach the summit. The footage was still valuable to help solving what really did happen since all the climbers had different stories about what happened.\",\"genres\":[\"Adventure\",\"Documentary\",\"Drama\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":294959,\"title\":\"Valley Uprising\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/9wjZdG4K1zkKmlh5DS2xxiEEVPK.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/bz75Gf7OPIJiq9lfrAesRK5h7SC.jpg\",\"rating\":7.7,\"year\":2014,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"In the shady campgrounds of Yosemite valley, climbers carved out a counterculture lifestyle of dumpster-diving and wild parties that clashed with the conservative values of the National Park Service. And up on the walls, generation after generation has pushed the limits of climbing, vying amongst each other for supremacy on Yosemite's cliffs. \\\"Valley Uprising\\\" is the riveting, unforgettable tale of this bold rock climbing tradition in Yosemite National Park: half a century of struggle against the laws of gravity -- and the laws of the land.\",\"genres\":[\"Adventure\",\"Documentary\",\"History\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":272044,\"title\":\"Venezuela Jungle Jam\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/gbU54CimGNZ3HB4479nMyiQb3SG.jpg\",\"backdrop\":null,\"rating\":10,\"year\":2012,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"The latest film from the Belgian climbing team, following Asgard Jamming and Vertical Sailing Greenland, Venezuela Jungle Jam features Sean Villanueva O'Driscoll, Nico Favresse, Stephane Hanssens and Jean-Louis Wertz as they attempt a new free climb on the overhanging 500m wall of Amuri Tepul in the Venezuelan Jungle.\",\"genres\":[\"Adventure\",\"Documentary\"],\"daysUntil\":null}],\"videos\":[{\"key\":\"XD_PZVMuJy8\",\"name\":\"The Devil’s Climb | Official Trailer | National Geographic\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"}],\"daysUntil\":null}","status":200,"url":""},"revalidate":86400,"tags":[]}